&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0782/0168/4263/files/3-9.2.jpg?v=1778409859" alt="Package Contents"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>网关信号不好？先看这几条</title><link>https://www.dieserc.com/zh/troubleshooting/2026/05/10/gateway-signal/</link><pubDate>Sun, 10 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.dieserc.com/zh/troubleshooting/2026/05/10/gateway-signal/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;和 &lt;strong&gt;故障排除&lt;/strong&gt; 里「设备老掉线」那条一起看：先在中心页按步骤做，再看下面两个常见问题。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage"&gt;
&lt;div class="accordion-item linktrol-ts-faq-item border-0 shadow-sm mb-2 rounded overflow-hidden" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"&gt;
 &lt;h2 class="accordion-header h5 mb-0"&gt;
 &lt;button class="accordion-button collapsed py-3" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-0-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-0-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084"&gt;
 &lt;span itemprop="name"&gt;先挪网关还是先加中继？&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;div id="faq-0-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084" class="accordion-collapse collapse" role="region"&gt;
 &lt;div class="accordion-body border-top" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"&gt;
 &lt;div itemprop="text"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;一次动一处&lt;/strong&gt;：先把网关或插电中继挪近信号差的设备，中间少隔墙。确认不是金属电箱、微波炉挡路，再考虑多买中继。&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="accordion-item linktrol-ts-faq-item border-0 shadow-sm mb-2 rounded overflow-hidden" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"&gt;
 &lt;h2 class="accordion-header h5 mb-0"&gt;
 &lt;button class="accordion-button collapsed py-3" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-1-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-1-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084"&gt;
 &lt;span itemprop="name"&gt;路由器换信道会影响 Zigbee 吗？&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;div id="faq-1-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084" class="accordion-collapse collapse" role="region"&gt;
 &lt;div class="accordion-body border-top" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"&gt;
 &lt;div itemprop="text"&gt;会。很多 Zigbee 也在 2.4 GHz。路由器老换信道会干扰。可以试试固定 Wi‑Fi 信道，或把 USB 网关棒用延长线拉离路由器。&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="linktrol-upgrade-banner card border-0 shadow-sm my-4" role="complementary"&gt;
 &lt;div class="card-body d-flex flex-column flex-md-row gap-3 align-items-md-center"&gt;
 &lt;div class="flex-grow-1"&gt;
 &lt;h3 class="h6 fw-bold mb-2"&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-up me-2 text-warning" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;设备用了好几年？&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;div class="small text-body-secondary mb-0"&gt;老网关有时修不如换。发邮件写上型号和购买渠道，我们帮你对接升级或优惠。&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="flex-shrink-0"&gt;
